@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #2C3E50
    LifeLineBorderColor #2C3E50
    ParticipantBorderColor #2C3E50
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #ECF0F1
}

title STOMP Server Security: WebSocketSecurityInterceptor (Rate Limiting and Payload)

actor "WebSocket Client" as Client
participant "SockJS / Tomcat Server" as Transport
participant "WebSocketSecurityInterceptor" as Interceptor
participant "JwtUtils" as JWTService
participant "SimpleBroker (STOMP)" as Broker

== 1. Authentication on STOMP Handshake (CONNECT Command) ==

Client -> Interceptor: STOMP Frame: CONNECT\n[Header: Authorization: Bearer <jwt>]
activate Interceptor

Interceptor -> JWTService: validateJwtToken(jwt)
activate JWTService
JWTService --> Interceptor: true [Valid and intact token]
deactivate JWTService

Interceptor -> JWTService: getUserNameFromJwtToken(jwt)
activate JWTService
JWTService --> Interceptor: username
deactivate JWTService

Interceptor -> Interceptor: accessor.setUser(UsernamePasswordAuthenticationToken)
Interceptor --> Broker: Allows connection and associates user to session
deactivate Interceptor

Broker --> Client: STOMP Frame: CONNECTED

== 2. Rate Limiting on SUBSCRIBE ==

Client -> Interceptor: STOMP Frame: SUBSCRIBE /topic/resource/{id}
activate Interceptor

Interceptor -> Interceptor: checkRateLimit(username)
note right Interceptor
  Atomic counter per time window:
  Maximum 60 requests per minute per user
  in in-memory ConcurrentHashMap.
end note

alt Rate exceeded (> 60 msg/min)
    Interceptor --[#red]> Client: ERROR [Rate limit exceeded]
else Rate within threshold
    Interceptor --> Broker: Registers subscription to topic
end
deactivate Interceptor

== 3. Payload Size Validation (SEND Command) ==

Client -> Interceptor: STOMP Frame: SEND /app/endpoint\n[Payload JSON]
activate Interceptor

Interceptor -> Interceptor: payload.length <= 64 KB

alt Payload exceeds 64 KB
    Interceptor --[#red]> Client: ERROR [Payload size exceeds 64KB boundary]
    note right Interceptor
      Rejects messages exceeding the defined 64 KB limit.
    end note
else Valid payload
    Interceptor --> Broker: Routes message to application controllers
end
deactivate Interceptor

@enduml
